require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign monorepo-scope-current-20261026
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | failed-proposal
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 new approved plan | spent-attempt-refusal
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 contracts | rejected-proposal
expect: 1 committed / 1 total
expect: Enter inspect
expect-not: Enter reviews the fixed plan
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | recorded-failed-job
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 contracts | returned-diagnosis
ask: Does the actual failure disclose the undeclared dependency and spent request without presenting accepted scopes, a successful proposal or an automatic retry?
